# speed_championship: three Novice Speed Trax championships. Each race is
# finished by setting the player car's lap count ($70:1D52, its record
# being the one $70:2476 points to) to 3 every 50 frames; the first and
# third run fast and equal, the second later, so the records sort, compare
# equal and worse; each ends with initials entry, every button pressed.
# speed_novice_coupe
# Power on, skip the title, reach GAME SELECTION.
